{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">尖沙咀海防道有食水管滲漏，影響鄰近一帶的食水供應。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事水管直徑450毫米，位於新港中心對出，水務署派出多名工程人員維修，又調派十多個水箱和四輛水車到場，供市民取水。旁邊的新港中心有食肆受影響，暫停營業。海防道和漢口道亦有部分大廈停水，有樓上餐廳照常營業。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PIPE-2100_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026sSNtkXqwdt1787407779.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.PIPE-2100_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PIPE-2100_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026lmWtZwEks81787407790.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.PIPE-2100_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">水務署指，工程團隊已鋪設一條臨時喉管，在晚上7時半前，恢復新港中心食肆的供水，爭取於明日早上約6時完成維修工程。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T14:19:50.446940+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}